sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant BFF as NestJS BFF
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over App,DB: 1. Authentication
    App->>KC: 1. Authorization code request (PKCE)
    KC-->>App: 2. Authorization code
    App->>KC: 3. Token exchange (code + code_verifier)
    KC-->>App: 4. access_token + refresh_token

    Note over App,DB: 2. API request
    App->>BFF: 5. API request (Bearer access_token)
    BFF->>KC: 6. JWKS request (public key, cached)
    KC-->>BFF: 7. Public key, cached by the BFF
    BFF->>BFF: 8. Signature and expiry check
    BFF->>DB: 9. Business logic
    DB-->>BFF: 10. Result
    BFF-->>App: 11. JSON response
